你总是这样的.哦,我来帮你.
Oh let me help you with that.

284
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:40,320
麦琪:哦,谢谢你杰森.你真是体贴.
Maggie: Oh thank you Jason, how very thoughtful of you.

285
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:40,420
