Luke, Ben, Mike, Chrissy: Een!!

298
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:31,880
本:哦,肯尼,第一天当小丑宣告结束了.
Ben: Well Kenny, my first day of geekdom is officially over.

299
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:34,920
肯尼:本,很多酷哥也戴眼镜的.
