本:是的.
Ben: Yes.

315
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:22,300
杰希卡:我叫杰希卡,你呢?
Jessica: My name is Jessica, what's yours?

316
00:18:28,580 --> 00:18:29,820
本:克拉克肯特.
Ben: Kent, Clark Kent.

317
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:30,000
杰希卡:你愿意陪我去车站吗,克拉克?
Jessica: You want to walk me to the bus Clark?

318
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:39,000
本:当然.大功告成.
Ben: Sure.Ba bing ba boom.

319
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,300
麦琪:道格,你这条隐藏在草丛里的毒蛇.
Maggie: Doug, you slimy snake in the grass.

320
00:18:41,300 --> 00:18:44,200
道格:你是个没脑子的笨狗.
Doug: You walking Cupee Dog.

321
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:49,500
杰森:司坦顿,你这只老蛤蟆.
Jason: Stanton you old Toad.

322
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:56,000
道格:嘿,够了,你伤着我了.
Doug: Hey, take it easy I got feelings.

323
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:56,300
杰森:对不起.
Jason: Sorry.

324
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:12,540
道格:坐下.麦琪马龙,杰森西沃.我们谈谈吧!
Doug: Sit.Maggie Malone, Jason Seaver.Talk to me!

325
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,700
麦琪:你叫他老蛤蟆!??
Maggie: You old toad!??

326
