等一下.
on it.I love this business.One minute.

330
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:34,380
杰森:我想,我们这么看他们是不对的.
Jason: I guess it would be wrong for us to look at them.

331
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:36,240
麦琪:是的,很不专业.
Maggie: Yes., very unprofessional.

332
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:40,200
杰森:哦!!我的文章没有一处批注!
Jason: Whoa!!Mine doesn't have a mark on it!

333
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:47,220
麦琪:可我的上面全是红墨水.
Maggie: Mine does, it's covered in red ink.

334
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:50,320
杰森:这并不意味着他不喜欢.
Jason: Well that doesn't necessarily mean he doesn't like it.

335
00:19:50,940 --> 00:19:53,500
麦琪:杰森,他耍了个花招.
Maggie: Jason, he used it as a coaster.

336
