我想是不是该向你表示祝贺了?
I suppose a congratulations are in order?

337
00:20:00,020 --> 00:20:02,560
杰森:亲爱的,相信我,当我鼓励你坚持下去的时候,我从没奢望,
Jason: Honey, believe me when I encouraged you to follow this thing through

338
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:07,560
哦,我奢望过,但我真的不想…
I never dreamed, well I dreamed, but I really didn't think...

339
00:20:08,900 --> 00:20:11,200
麦琪:杰森,我替你感到高兴.
Maggie: Jason I'm very happy for you.

340
