Jason: I know you are.I'll make it up to you.

341
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:23,680
道格:好了,刚才说到哪了?哦,对.我太太说我对人太粗暴了.我正努力改正呢.杰森,我喜欢你的领带.
Doug: Ok, well where were we?Oh right.My wife tells me I'm too blunt

342
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:26,800
with people.I'm trying to work on it.Jason, I love your tie

343
