麦琪做几处改动,我们可以发表在晨报上面.
Maggie make a few changes, we can get that in the morning edition.

346
00:20:40,580 --> 00:20:41,760
麦琪:你把专栏给我了吗?
Maggie: You're giving me the column?

347
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:41,860
