我实在不想看第二遍.
I just couldn't face reading that again.

352
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:59,660
杰森:我的文章就没你喜欢的吗?
Jason: Well was there anything you liked about mine?

353
00:20:59,660 --> 00:21:03,400
