Doug: Uhhh....Uhhh....Umm...

354
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,200
杰森:好吧.我懂了.
Jason: Ok, I get the picture.

355
00:21:09,060 --> 00:21:09,840
麦琪:哦,杰森.
Maggie: Oh Jason.

356
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:12,540
杰森:我懂了.我懂了.没关系的.
Jason: I got it, I got it.That's no problem, it's fine.

357
00:21:15,180 --> 00:21:16,060
我没事.这很好.家里再见吧.
That's ok , I'll see you at home.

358
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:22,000
麦琪:亲爱的.
Maggie: Honey.

359
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:22,900
杰森:呃,呃.
Jason: Uh huh.

360
00:21:22,900 --> 00:21:23,700
