麦琪,你就是这样的专家.
hard look so easy Maggie.And you are a pro.

378
00:22:26,020 --> 00:22:32,680
麦琪:哦,杰森!你不觉得屋里有点热吗?
Maggie: Oh Jason!Don't you think it's a little warm in here?

379
00:22:33,900 --> 00:22:35,440
杰森:我去开窗户.
Jason: I will open the window.

380
00:22:37,060 --> 00:22:41,980
麦琪:哦,不是,不是那种热.
Maggie: No no, not that kind of warm puppy toes. Jason: Oh...

381
00:22:44,100 --> 00:22:45,240
杰森:哦…是那种热.00:22:37,300
that kind of warm.
